NOTICE

This file records the BSL 1.1 parameters for this package. The canonical,
full license text is published at https://mariadb.com/bsl11/ and MUST be
pasted here verbatim, beneath these parameters, before this package is
published to npm — a parameters block alone is not a license grant.

Everything else in this repository (`@tollway/core`, `@tollway/express`,
`@tollway/coinbase`, `@tollway/gate`) is MIT, and none of it depends on this
package. The SDK gates routes, verifies payments and issues receipts with no
Tollway account and no BSL code in the tree; this package is additive, exactly
as specs/sdk.md §1.1 requires.
